{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234280","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234280","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1423428001:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 보이는 것처럼 너무 바빠서 제대로 인사도 못하겠네.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x618D98A6F42A814D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 보이는 것처럼 너무 바빠서 제대로 인사도 못하겠네.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 보이는 것처럼 너무 바빠서 제대로 인사도 못하겠네.","variant_male_record_index":"171884","variant_female_record_index":"171885","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423428002:1":{"text":"사리에가 시레이를 도와주라고 보낸 거예요!","source_cn":"其实是沙利叶请我们来帮你的啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5A85D8608B7754C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423428003:1":{"text":"그럼 시간이 촉박하니까 사양하지 않을게.","source_cn":"那么时间紧急，我也不客气了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3BA08C094EB5B14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423428004:1":{"text":"지금 일손도 재료도 다 부족하단 말이지. 심지어는 가장 기본적인 석재랑 목재도 없어...","source_cn":"现在我这里人手和材料都不足，连最基本的木料和石材都缺……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E0E96F0C76FAD60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423428005:1":{"text":"혹시 <style=\"highlight\">목재</style>랑 <style=\"highlight\">석재</sty